%erg 0.1
Title: Fix beat-skip.json schema mismatch in housekeeping-git.sh
Created: 2026-05-29
Author: MinhHaDuong

--- log ---
2026-05-29T13:37Z MinhHaDuong created

--- body ---
## Context

`scripts/housekeeping-git.sh` prints a jq error on every run when a
`.git/beat-skip.json` file exists:

```
jq: error (at .git/beat-skip.json:5): Cannot index array with string "entries"
```

The failure is graceful (the `else rm -f "$TMP"` branch leaves the file
unchanged), so the **beat-skip expiry logic is silently a no-op** — expired
skip entries are never pruned.

Two-sided schema mismatch:

1. **Script bug.** The expiry filter targets `.entries`:
   `jq '.entries |= [.[] | select(.until == null or .until > $now)]'`.
   But the canonical schema, per `skills/pick-ticket/SKILL.md` (the
   reader/writer of this file), is a **top-level array of objects**:
   `[{ "id": "...", "until": "...", "reason": "..." }, ...]`.
   `.entries` on a top-level array errors **regardless of content** — so
   this is a script fix, not a data-cleanup. (Cleaning a consumer repo's
   local file does NOT silence the error.)

2. **Legacy data format.** Observed in the wild (git-erg's
   `.git/beat-skip.json`): a plain **string array** `["0001","0012",...]`,
   predating the object schema. Even with the filter fixed to operate on a
   top-level array, `.until` on a string element would error. The fix must
   tolerate or migrate legacy string entries.

Discovered during a `/housekeeping` run on git-erg (2026-05-29).

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `housekeeping-git.sh` expiry filter operates on the top-level array
      (`map(select(.until == null or .until > $now))`), matching
      `pick-ticket/SKILL.md`'s schema — no `.entries` indexing.
- [ ] Legacy string-array entries are tolerated (skipped or migrated to
      `{id}` objects) without erroring.
- [ ] Running the script against both schemas (object array, legacy string
      array, empty `[]`) produces no jq error on stderr.
- [ ] Expired entries (`until` < now) are actually pruned; indefinite
      entries (`until` absent) are preserved.
